{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09502","headline":"荅畅参军 · 韦应物","name":"荅畅参军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秉笔振芳步，少年且吏游。\n官闲高兴生，夜直河汉秋。\n念与清赏遇，方抱沈疾忧。\n嘉言忽见赠，良药同所瘳。\n高树起栖鸦，晨钟满皇州。\n凄清露华动，旷朗景气浮。\n偶宦心非累，处喧道自幽。\n空虚爲世薄，子独意绸缪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}